<Table class="oracle.dbtools.crest.model.design.relational.Table" directorySegmentName="seg_0" id="F9D393AF-EB25-EAA2-BB45-3E8492C85D32" name="EXCLUSIVE_RELATIONS">
<createdBy>stb</createdBy>
<createdTime>2024-12-24 13:09:16 UTC</createdTime>
<comment><![CDATA[Relationships that emanate from an entity can be exclusive. I.e. none or 1 of them is possible, but never several simultaneously.

Example:
a Person is reachable via Mobile-Phone or via Land-Line-Phone]]></comment>
<generatorID>7508B13D-A32D-4C04-D788-8F40843FC2CD</generatorID>
<notes><![CDATA[[DE_ENTI_COMMENT[
Beziehungen die von einer Entität ausgehen können exklusiv sein. D.h. keine oder 1 davon ist möglich, aber nie mehrere gleichzeitig

Beispiel:
	eine Person ist erreichbar über Mobil-Telefon oder über Festnetz-Telefon
]DE_ENTI_COMMENT]
[EN_ENTI_COMMENT[
Relationships that emanate from an entity can be exclusive. I.e. none or 1 of them is possible, but never several simultaneously.

Example:
	a Person is reachable via Mobile-Phone or via Land-Line-Phone
]EN_ENTI_COMMENT]
]]></notes>
